f the following diagrams shows all the $6$th roots of unity?" :question/worked-solution "Geometrically, the $6$th roots of unity have the following properties:\n\n- all of them lie on the unit circle centered in the origin,\n\n- one of the roots is $1,$ corresponding to the point $(1,0)$ on the complex plane,\n\n- the roots form a regular hexagon (regular $6$-sided polygon).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/923d1a1b87833551ae6c451f15a6b5d8bdd75623e8d5c20e86357894bc24683d.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186320684 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0c2c755c-59e0-5048-b20c-507f13fce441" :knowledge-point/title "Geometric Interpretation of the Roots of Unity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ce725b8-a924-51f3-bdf3-a74157eed07e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/b4510002c6e424de6ea16f3037237ea9628b0ddd61f7fa4643d412b66b4fd749.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186320686} {:answer/id #uuid "c5e326cb-46cd-538c-90d2-30061dabb25b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/0525436f0f1ea9283c783bf590ae6dd58408ba5d5e2e6f69fc83af86e470864d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186320687} {:answer/id #uuid "45adc3d6-c7f3-5c48-adf0-19de57721eb3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/f15f43e3663cfee8328135cb30894c4f268004f4bb74c838cb1bbf2c654c19f9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186320688} {:answer/id #uuid "e30e23e4-19c2-58ca-8e3b-45c1cf6e2a8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/59cc6771efc546c